# 18. IMPORTANT TECHNICAL REQUIREMENTS

The final game must be fully playable and functional.

If developing this as a browser game, build it using HTML, CSS and JavaScript with a suitable 3D engine such as Three.js.

The game should run directly in a modern browser without requiring the player to install additional software or use a complicated development environment.

### Performance

This game will contain a large ocean, boats, crew members, shipwrecks, particles, waves, merchants and many other objects.

Optimise the game carefully:
- Use procedural generation.
